        <activityName xml:lang="en">Precast concrete, standard concrete, only common base, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Precast concrete, standard concrete, only common base, at plant
Dataset describes the production of standard precast concrete elements using partly self compacting concrete and producing elements of a structural robustness below C70. Excludes the transportation to the construction site;
UUID: 2997ae30-6872-3b30-9960-140cdccf58c4
Includes infrastructure, energy demand, treatment of wastes but does not include the ingredients / composition of the precast concrete.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Formation with wooden boards
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2997ae30-6872-3b30-9960-140cdccf58c4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
